 # Changelog
 
+## 1.6.0
+
+- Ticket assignment. `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee` with `{"assignee": "<agent>"}` assigns an open or in-progress ticket
+  to an agent (a name of at most 64 characters), `{"assignee": null}` unassigns it. The agent is notified
+  (`ticket.assigned`); assigning the agent a ticket already has changes nothing. A ticket shows its `assignee`.
+- `GET /tickets?assignee=<agent>` lists an agent's tickets, `assignee=` the unassigned ones.
+- Fixed: filters of `GET /tickets` combine as documented, a ticket must match every filter given (it matched any).
+- The command line shows the assignee (`list`, `show`, `--assignee`); `list --raw` has it as a fifth column.
+- `ASSIGNEES=on` makes a ticket nobody is assigned to show `assignee: null`; until then it has no `assignee` field, as
+  before 1.6.0, and an assigned ticket shows its assignee.
+
 ## 1.5.0
 
 - Due times ([decision 9](docs/decisions/0009-due-times.md)). Every ticket gets a due time, `due`: the time it was created
