+### Assign a ticket: `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee`
+
+```json
+{ "assignee": "dana" }
+```
+
+Assigns the ticket to that agent, a non-empty name of at most 64 characters, or unassigns it with `{ "assignee": null }`.
+Answers 200 with the ticket. Only `open` and `in_progress` tickets can be assigned or unassigned (409 `conflict`
+otherwise); a missing or invalid `assignee` is 400 `invalid`. The agent is notified that the ticket was assigned to them.
+Assigning the agent the ticket already has (or unassigning an unassigned ticket) changes nothing: no audit entry, no
+notification, and `updated` stays. Audit actions: `ticket.assigned`, `ticket.unassigned`.
